{"id": 3, "ts": 1780564573.371994, "event": "public_discussion_message", "round": 1, "agent": "sarah_mitchell", "message": "I\u2019d like to put forward Candidate\u202fB as my provisional recommendation.\u202fB\u2019s profile hits several of our core criteria: he is described as \u201cvery conscientious,\u201d which speaks to operational reliability, and he \u201chandles stress very well,\u201d directly addressing calmness under pressure\u2014a must for long\u2011distance flights. His ability to \u201cassess weather conditions\u201d and his \u201cexcellent computer skills\u201d demonstrate the technical and cognitive competence we need for complex international routes. While the notes do flag that B can be \u201cgrumpy\u201d and \u201cuncooperative,\u201d I view these as behavioral traits that can be mitigated through crew\u2011resource\u2011management training and clear expectations, especially given his strong reliability and stress resilience. Compared with the other candidates, B offers the most balanced mix of reliability, technical skill, and stress handling, with the cooperation issue being the only notable downside."}
